  {
   "id": "studio",
   "text": "It starts on the web. Drop in a PDF or paste your notes, and LOCI reads them and pulls out the key ideas. Prefer your own? Just type the words you want to remember. Then give each idea a picture. Describe it, and Meta's AI draws it for you. Or let it draw every card at once, each one a little stranger than the last. Got a picture of your own? Just upload it. Then pick a room: a sunlit living room, a kitchen, a bedroom, or your own space. And build your palace.",
